            "richtext": "<h3><em><strong>Breathe Deeper: True Wellness Starts With the Air Around You</strong></em> </h3><p> </p><p>You light your favorite candle, take a few calming breaths, and settle in for a well-deserved moment of peace. But what if the space around you isn’t helping you relax? Even the most carefully crafted self-care routine can be quietly sabotaged by the one thing we often overlook — our environment. </p><p>At Blueair, we believe self-care starts with clean air. Because when your surroundings are healthy, your body and mind can truly rest, recharge, and thrive. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
