            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>3. The Air-Sleep Connection</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Good sleep is the foundation of self-care. It’s when your body repairs, your skin rejuvenates, and your mind resets. But if your bedroom air is filled with dust, allergens, or lingering pollutants, your sleep quality can suffer. </p><p>Clean air helps your body reach deeper, more restorative sleep. Blueair purifiers operate whisper-quietly, so they clean your air all night long without interrupting your dreams. </p><p><em>💡 Wellness tip: Keep your purifier running in auto mode while you sleep. You’ll wake up feeling lighter, clearer, and genuinely refreshed.</em> </p><p> </p><h4><strong>4. Breathwork, Meditation, and Mindful Air</strong> </h4><p></p><p>If the air you’re breathing is polluted, every day breathing to deep breathing exercises can be counterproductive. Clean air allows your lungs — and your mind — to work in harmony, making mindfulness practices more effective. </p><p>Imagine meditating in a space where every inhale brings clarity, not contaminants. That’s the difference you can feel when your air is pure. </p><p><em>💡 Wellness tip: Before your next meditation or yoga session, let your Blueair purifier run for 20 minutes. Notice how the air — and your breath —  feel lighter, calmer, and more alive.</em> </p><p> </p><h4><strong>5. Designing a Wellness-First Environment</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Self-care isn’t just about what you do — it’s about where you do it. Your home should feel like an extension of your well-being. </p><p>Here are a few small changes that make a big difference: </p><ul><li>Choose natural cleaning products with fewer synthetic chemicals </li><li>Add houseplants to improve air quality and lift your mood </li><li>Let in natural light whenever possible </li><li>Keep surfaces clean and clutter-free </li><li>Use an air purifier designed for your space size </li></ul><p></p><p>When your surroundings support you, your self-care routine becomes effortless and more effective. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
