            "richtext": "<h4><strong>6. The Foundation of Everyday Wellness</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Your self-care routine doesn’t need to be complicated — it needs to be consistent. Clean air is one of the simplest, most powerful foundations for long-term well-being. By caring for your environment, you’re also caring for yourself. </p><p>At Blueair, we believe every breath should support your health. Because true wellness isn’t just what you put into your body — it’s what surrounds you every day. </p>",
